00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:39.360
bring you happiness if you do then you're living in a dream power isn't going to help you escape the

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:44.870
loneliness you feel because you don't have any friends it just makes it worse take it from me

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:51.220
the more powerful you get the more alone you become can't take the truth can you i came as

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:57.670
fast as i could grandpa i'm sorry to get here so late my boy it's been a long time but i remember

00:15:57.670 --> 00:15:59.190
Remember, you were a good friend of Iroki.

00:15:59.490 --> 00:15:59.970
You never had a good friend of Iroki.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.680
I had many friends, and I always thought you were a bit of an odd duck.

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:05.260
But I never imagined you'd go completely mad.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:06.780
Who are you?

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:09.800
Want to know how I know you so well? Yukio?

00:16:10.020 --> 00:16:13.080
You see, I'm Cody's grandfather and Hiroki's father.

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:15.020
His father?

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:19.540
You two spent hours together playing games and making up outrageous stories.

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:21.840
You actually believed the characters were real.

00:16:22.100 --> 00:16:24.860
You were so lost in this world, I thought your minds would rot.

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:28.040
Pretty soon I had to put my foot down and bring an end to it.

00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:29.760
You both took it very hard.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.940
I still remember the sad looks on your faces.

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:32.960
You were miserable.

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:35.580
Things never changed as you grew up.

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:37.600
You still spent long periods of time

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:40.160
dreaming about that strange other world of yours.

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:42.800
You never let anyone else share in your thoughts

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:43.700
because if you did,

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:45.640
you were afraid they would take them away.

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:47.780
Then one day it happened.

00:16:48.140 --> 00:16:49.580
Hiroki was gone forever.

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:51.640
You were beside yourself with grief.

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:54.050
You became a lost and lonely soul.

00:16:54.420 --> 00:16:55.300
It wasn't normal.

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:58.040
But then Hiroki had been your only friend.

00:16:58.380 --> 00:16:59.970
I wish I could have seen it come...

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.490
I would have tried to make it easier for you.

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:05.350
I've never seen anyone so sad in my life.

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:08.830
I have to say, it was a very difficult thing to watch.

00:17:09.110 --> 00:17:11.380
You may not be interested in hearing this,

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:13.250
but I'd like to be your friend.

00:17:13.650 --> 00:17:15.790
It would be nice to talk to someone about my son.

00:17:16.280 --> 00:17:17.520
Do you think that would be all right?

00:17:20.550 --> 00:17:21.930
Miss him even more than I do.

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:56.940
looking too neighborly to me no you can't be there must be something more to this than we can see

00:17:56.940 --> 00:17:59.100
how could i have been so blind

00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:08.540
You're perfectly right about being alone. We're both doomed to remain this way forever. There isn't any other choice

00:18:09.010 --> 00:18:15.550
He's controlling you. This changes everything. You're very perceptive for someone so narrow-minded

00:18:15.550 --> 00:18:22.330
I have to harvest all the dark spores in order for me to fulfill my deepest desire. I've always wanted to go to the digital world

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:29.830
He must not be allowed into the digital world ever again. What do you mean?

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:34.070
Yeah, and nobody ever tells me anything! You all right, big guy?

00:18:34.230 --> 00:18:36.370
My body's not going to last much longer.

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:40.230
The image created by the control spires will soon start to break up,

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:42.790
but there's still something I have to do.

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:43.970
Save your strength!

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:48.180
No, my strength is my final gift to you, my friends.

00:18:48.630 --> 00:18:52.010
I will seal the Heightened View Terrace gate with my own body.

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:53.130
Don't do it!

00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:54.070
I must!

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:09.120
He always wanted to do something meaningful with his life.

00:19:09.220 --> 00:19:11.100
I'd say this definitely qualifies.

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:15.310
Black War Greymon! Black War Greymon!

00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:22.800
Been another way.

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:29.540
Black War Greymon?

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:33.020
My friend, never forget you.

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:36.200
Black War Greymon sealed the gate,

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:38.280
but will the imposter that's controlling Owikawa

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:39.120
find a way to get through?

00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:40.700
Find out on the next episode of

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:42.400
Digimon Digital Monsters.
